# Project Structure Guide

## Main Directories
- `src/routes/`: Contains all Svelte routes and pages
- `src/lib/`: Shared components and utilities
- `src/satellite/`: Backend/smart contract related code
- `src/utils/`: Helper functions and utilities
- `static/`: Static assets and files

## Key Files
- @app.html: Main HTML template
- @routes/+layout.svelte: Root layout component
- @routes/global.styles.css: Global styles
- @satellite/satellite.did: Main canister interface

## Component Organization
- Components should be placed in `src/lib/components/`
- Route-specific components should be co-located with their routes
- Shared utilities should go in `src/utils/`
- Smart contract code belongs in `src/satellite/`